{"seq":1,"slug":"genetic-engineering","title":"高二生物 — 基因工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/genetic-engineering","wordCount":2015,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二生物-基因工程\">高二生物 — 基因工程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>基因工程是在分子水平上对基因进行操作的技术体系，它能够按照人的意愿将一种生物的特定基因转移到另一种生物中，使后者获得新的遗传性状。这项技术的诞生标志着人类从被动观察遗传现象转变为主动改造遗传信息，是现代生物技术的核心支柱。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基因工程</td>\n<td>按照预先设计的方案，将目的基因导入受体细胞并使之表达的技术</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目的基因</td>\n<td>需要转移的、编码目标性状的基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>载体</td>\n<td>携带目的基因进入受体细胞的 DNA 分子（如质粒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限制酶</td>\n<td>识别特定 DNA 序列并将其切断的工具酶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNA 连接酶</td>\n<td>将两段 DNA 分子连接起来的酶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受体细胞</td>\n<td>接受目的基因的宿主细胞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-基因工程的基本工具\">一、基因工程的基本工具</h3><p>基因工程有三把核心&quot;分子工具&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>（1）限制性核酸内切酶（&quot;基因剪刀&quot;）</strong></p>\n<p>限制酶能识别双链 DNA 上特定的碱基序列（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\sim 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 个碱基对的回文序列），并在特定位点切割 DNA。</p>\n<p>例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mtext>R</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Eco\\text{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span></span></span></span></span>I 识别并切割的序列：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext>-G</mtext><mo>↓</mo><mtext>AATTC-</mtext><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27;\\text{-G}\\downarrow\\text{AATTC-}3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9963em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-G</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AATTC-</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext>-CTTAA</mtext><mo>↑</mo><mtext>G-</mtext><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27;\\text{-CTTAA}\\uparrow\\text{G-}5&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9963em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-CTTAA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G-</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>切割后产生的末端有两种类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>应用优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>黏性末端</td>\n<td>切口处留有几个碱基的单链突出</td>\n<td>互补配对效率高，连接效率高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平末端</td>\n<td>切口处齐平，无突出单链</td>\n<td>通用性强但连接效率较低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>（2）DNA 连接酶（&quot;基因针线&quot;）</strong></p>\n<p>将两段 DNA 末端的磷酸二酯键连接起来。分为两种：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>T</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{T}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> DNA 连接酶：既能连黏性末端也能连平末端</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E.coli</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> DNA 连接酶：只能连黏性末端</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>（3）载体（&quot;基因运输车&quot;）</strong></p>\n<p>载体是将目的基因导入受体细胞的运输工具。最常用的载体是<strong>细菌质粒</strong>——一种环状小分子 DNA。</p>\n<p>载体需具备的条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有限制酶切割位点</td>\n<td>便于插入目的基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有自我复制能力</td>\n<td>能在受体细胞中复制扩增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有标记基因</td>\n<td>便于筛选（如抗生素抗性基因）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>足够小</td>\n<td>便于操作和导入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-基因工程的基本操作步骤\">二、基因工程的基本操作步骤</h3><p>基因工程操作可概括为四步：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：获取目的基因</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从基因文库中获取</td>\n<td>将某生物的全部基因片段插入载体保存</td>\n<td>已知目标生物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利用 PCR 技术扩增</td>\n<td>在体外用 DNA 聚合酶指数扩增特定 DNA 片段</td>\n<td>已知目的基因序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学合成法</td>\n<td>根据已知序列人工合成 DNA</td>\n<td>基因较短时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆转录法</td>\n<td>从 mRNA 逆转录得到 cDNA</td>\n<td>已知表达产物的细胞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>PCR 技术</strong>（聚合酶链式反应）尤为重要：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DNA 模板</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>引物</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>dNTPs</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>热稳定 DNA 聚合酶</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>变性</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>退火</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>延伸</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mtext>倍的目的基因</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DNA 模板} + \\text{引物} + \\text{dNTPs} + \\text{热稳定 DNA 聚合酶} \\xrightarrow{变性-退火-延伸} 2^n \\text{倍的目的基因}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模板</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">引物</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dNTPs</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">热稳定</span><span class=\"mord\"> DNA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">聚合酶</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">变性</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">退火</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">延伸</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">倍的目的基因</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 轮循环，目的基因片段理论上扩增 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍。每轮循环包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>变性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：双链 DNA 解旋为单链</li>\n<li>退火（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55 \\sim 65°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：引物与模板互补结合</li>\n<li>延伸（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：DNA 聚合酶合成新链</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第二步：构建基因表达载体（重组 DNA 分子）</strong></p>\n<p>用<strong>同一种限制酶</strong>分别切割目的基因和载体，产生相同的黏性末端，然后用 DNA 连接酶将目的基因片段插入载体中。</p>\n<p>构建好的基因表达载体通常包含：启动子 → 目的基因 → 终止子 + 标记基因。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步：将基因表达载体导入受体细胞</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>受体细胞</th>\n<th>导入方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>细菌</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CaCl</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CaCl}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CaCl</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处理使细胞壁通透性增加（转化法）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>植物细胞</td>\n<td>农杆菌转化法（利用 Ti 质粒）或基因枪法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动物细胞</td>\n<td>显微注射法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第四步：检测与筛选</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测层次</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>检测内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分子水平</td>\n<td>DNA 分子杂交</td>\n<td>目的基因是否插入受体染色体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转录水平</td>\n<td>RNA 分子杂交</td>\n<td>目的基因是否转录出 mRNA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>翻译水平</td>\n<td>抗原-抗体杂交</td>\n<td>目的基因是否表达出蛋白质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个体水平</td>\n<td>表型观察</td>\n<td>受体生物是否出现目标性状</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-基因工程的应用\">三、基因工程的应用</h3><p><strong>（1）医药领域</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>生产人胰岛素：将人胰岛素基因导入大肠杆菌，大规模发酵生产</li>\n<li>生产干扰素、生长激素等药物蛋白</li>\n<li>基因治疗：将正常基因导入患者体细胞，替代或弥补缺陷基因</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>（2）农业领域</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>转基因抗虫棉：导入苏云金芽孢杆菌的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Bt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 毒蛋白基因</li>\n<li>抗除草剂作物：导入抗草甘膦基因</li>\n<li>营养增强作物：如黄金大米（含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-胡萝卜素合成基因）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>（3）环境保护</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>利用转基因微生物降解石油污染</li>\n<li>利用转基因植物修复重金属污染土壤</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-安全性争议\">四、安全性争议</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关切领域</th>\n<th>具体问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>食品安全</td>\n<td>转基因食品是否影响人体健康？过敏原风险？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态安全</td>\n<td>基因漂移到野生近缘种？对非目标生物的影响？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伦理问题</td>\n<td>人类基因编辑的边界在哪里？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>目前科学界的主流观点是：经过严格安全评估的转基因产品与传统产品同样安全。但社会层面的讨论仍在继续，各国都建立了转基因生物安全管理法规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为什么构建重组 DNA 分子时要用同一种限制酶切割目的基因和载体？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>PCR 技术中为什么要使用热稳定 DNA 聚合酶（如 Taq 酶）而不是普通的 DNA 聚合酶？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>基因工程中&quot;标记基因&quot;的作用是什么？如果没有标记基因，如何筛选含有目的基因的受体细胞？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>转基因抗虫棉导入的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Bt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 毒蛋白基因，该基因来自苏云金芽孢杆菌。这体现了基因工程的什么特点？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>有人担心转基因作物的抗除草剂基因可能通过花粉传播到杂草中，产生&quot;超级杂草&quot;。这种担忧是否合理？如何降低这种风险？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>2020 年诺贝尔化学奖授予了夏彭蒂耶和杜德纳，表彰她们开发的 CRISPR-Cas9 基因编辑技术。这项技术比传统基因工程更精确、更高效、成本更低——被称为&quot;基因剪刀 2.0&quot;。CRISPR 的原理来源于细菌的免疫系统：细菌用 CRISPR 序列记住入侵病毒的 DNA 片段，下次遇到时用 Cas9 蛋白精准切割病毒 DNA。科学家借鉴这一机制，开发出了可编程的基因编辑工具。</p>\n<p>2018 年&quot;基因编辑婴儿&quot;事件引发了全球科学伦理界的强烈反应。研究者使用 CRISPR 编辑了人类胚胎的 CCR5 基因（试图使婴儿对 HIV 产生抗性），但这一行为违反了科学伦理规范——生殖系基因编辑可能产生不可预测的脱靶效应，且这些变化将遗传给后代。这一事件促使多国加强了对人类基因编辑的监管。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>基因工程的核心工具：限制酶（剪切）、DNA 连接酶（连接）、载体（运输）</li>\n<li>四个基本步骤：获取目的基因 → 构建表达载体 → 导入受体细胞 → 检测筛选</li>\n<li>PCR 技术可在体外快速扩增特定 DNA 片段，每轮循环扩增一倍</li>\n<li>基因工程在医药、农业和环保领域有广泛应用</li>\n<li>转基因安全性需要科学评估和社会讨论的双轨并行</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二生物 — 基因工程","id":"高二生物-基因工程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、基因工程的基本工具","id":"一-基因工程的基本工具"},{"level":3,"text":"二、基因工程的基本操作步骤","id":"二-基因工程的基本操作步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"三、基因工程的应用","id":"三-基因工程的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"四、安全性争议","id":"四-安全性争议"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二生物 — 生态系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/ecology-adv/ecosystem-ecology"},"next":{"title":"高二生物 — 细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/cell-engineering"}}